    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Harrington brings 8 Emmet Road to the market, a three-bedroom home arranged over three floors in the heart of Kilmainham. With its living space set above the bedrooms, a private outdoor area to the reat with storage for bikes or other and electric-gated off-street parking for up to 3 cars to the front, the property offers a distinctive layout in a well-connected Dublin 8 location.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor comprises an entrance hall, two bedrooms and the main bathroom , with access to the paved courtyard. The first floor is dedicated to day-to-day living, with a bright living/ dining room and a Juliet balcony to the front. On the top floor, the third bedroom is exceptionally large and is accompanied by another bathroom and a balcony overlooking greenery.\r\n\r\nKilmainham offers an appealing mix of neighbourhood cafés, local shops and historic landmarks, with Kilmainham Gaol, the Irish Museum of Modern Art and the grounds of the Royal Hospital Kilmainham nearby. The Phoenix Park and War Memorial Gardens provide further outdoor space within easy reach. Bus services and the Luas Red Line connect the area with Dublin city centre and beyond.\r\n\r\nThe combination of three bedrooms, outdoor space and secure off-street parking makes 8 Emmet Road a compelling opportunity for buyers seeking a home close to the city."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground floor: Entrance hall, two bedrooms, shower room and access to the paved courtyard and storage area.\r\n\r\nFirst floor: Living and dining room with Juliet balcony and separate fitted kitchen.\r\n\r\nTop floor: Large third bedroom, main bathroom and balcony."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Three-bedroom home arranged over three floors\r\nElectric-gated off-street parking for up to 3 cars to the front\r\nPrivate paved courtyard and storage area to the rear\r\nExceptionally large bedroom on the top floor with private balcony\r\nSeparate first-floor living and dining room with access to Juliet balcony\r\nConvenient Kilmainham location with access to local amenities, parks and public transport"
      }
    ],
